## NSolve
Approximate solutions to a polynomial equation:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
NSolve[(*SpB[*)Power[x(*|*),(*|*)5](*]SpB*) - 2 x + 3 == 0, x]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
{{x->-1.4236058485523317`},{x->-0.24672925691056408`-1.3208163474502472` I},{x->-0.24672925691056408`+1.3208163474502472` I},{x->0.9585321811867298` -0.49842777903184593` I},{x->0.9585321811867298` +0.49842777903184593` I}}

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Solve the equation 

$$

sin(z + sin(z + sin(z))) = cos(z + cos(z + cos(z)))

$$

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Solve the equation 

$$

sin(z + sin(z + sin(z))) = cos(z + cos(z + cos(z)))

$$

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
eq[z_] := Sin[z + Sin[z + Sin[z]]] == Cos[z + Cos[z + Cos[z]]]

roots = NSolve[eq[z] && -3 < 
     Re[z] < 3 && -3 < Im[z] < 3, z, MaxRoots -> Infinity];

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
ListPlot[{Re[z], Im[z]} /. roots, 
 PlotLabel -> 
  ToString[Sin[z + Sin[z + Sin[z]]] == Cos[z + Cos[z + Cos[z]]], InputForm]]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(FrontEndRef["Ff496dc10-dd91-49e3-a09c-5441764837b8"])(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNkYGAoZgESHvk5KRCeEJBwK8rPK3HNS3GtSE0uLUlMykkNVgUJp5lYmqUkGxropqRYGuqaWKYa6yYaWCbrmpqYGJqbmVgYmydZAACZEhVq"*)(*]VB*)

